<title>POLAND: Espebepe surges after debt write-off deal.</title>
<headline>Espebepe surges after debt write-off deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Espebepe SA surged 9.6 percent to 7.45 zlotys on Monday, the session after creditors accepted the company's version of a debt-relief deal envisaging an 80-percent write-off, traders said.</p>
<p>On Friday creditors holding 58.7 million zlotys of the company's approximate 75-million-zloty debt voted for the deal that needed 56.4 million zlotys worth of votes to pass.</p>
<p>The stock did not trade after price fixing due to excess demand, flagging another jump on Tuesday, analysts said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
